(1. What is Raudra Rasa?) Tj
/F1 14 Tf
1 0 0 1 72 720 Tm
(Raudra \(the Furious\) is the rasa of anger, wrath, righteous violence,) Tj
1 0 0 1 72 696 Tm
(and eruptive moral force in Indian aesthetic theory.) Tj
1 0 0 1 72 672 Tm
() Tj
1 0 0 1 72 648 Tm
(Primary emotional basis \(sthayi bhava\): Krodha \(anger\).) Tj
1 0 0 1 72 624 Tm
(Classical source: Bharata Muni's Natyashastra.) Tj
ET
endstream
endobj
