(2. Structural Components of Raudra) Tj
/F1 14 Tf
1 0 0 1 72 720 Tm
(Vibhava \(determinants\): insult, injustice, betrayal, oppression, war.) Tj
1 0 0 1 72 696 Tm
(Anubhava \(consequents\): red eyes, harsh speech, flared nostrils, attack.) Tj
1 0 0 1 72 672 Tm
(Vyabhichari bhavas: impatience, agitation, cruelty, resolve, trembling.) Tj
1 0 0 1 72 648 Tm
() Tj
1 0 0 1 72 624 Tm
(Raudra can be personal, social, political, or cosmic in expression.) Tj
ET
endstream
endobj
