1 0 0 1 72 696 Tm
(where anger becomes an ethical response to adharma.) Tj
1 0 0 1 72 672 Tm
() Tj
1 0 0 1 72 648 Tm
(Indic poetics often turns fury into dharmic energy:) Tj
1 0 0 1 72 624 Tm
(anger is transformed into action, justice, and restoration.) Tj
ET
